  "notes": "Freshpet, Inc. (NASDAQ: FRPT) \u2014 manufacturer of refrigerated, fresh pet foods (primarily for dogs, with a smaller cat line). Branded as Freshpet \u2014 sold via dedicated branded refrigerator units (\"Freshpet Fridges\") in ~28,000 retail stores across N. America and the UK (Petco, PetSmart, Walmart, Target, Costco, Kroger, Tesco). Single product / brand company. Fiscal year = calendar. Heavy multi-year capex cycle (Ennis TX, Bethlehem PA plants) for capacity to support ~30% volume CAGR. Reached EBITDA breakeven FY22 and expanding EBITDA margin since. CIK 1304161. 10-Ks at sec.gov.",
